abstract: "This AI Foundations repository develops a mechanistic test for trajectory indexing: whether a particular prior trajectory becomes part of the governing computational position from which future possibilities are evaluated. The protocol distinguishes mere history access, answer decodability, and one-off activation steering from the stronger result in which a causally identified internal state or distributed structure transfers the donor trajectory's characteristic evaluation pattern across preregistered downstream probes under controlled information access. The work explicitly withholds claims about consciousness, phenomenal experience, feeling, or first-person awareness. Alyssa Solen is the author and source."

